<style>
:root{font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui,sans-serif);color:var(--color-text-primary,#1b2636);background:var(--color-background-primary,#fff);font-size:14px}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;padding:20px}main{max-width:720px;margin:auto}h1{font-size:1.4rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{line-height:1.5}form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}label,fieldset{display:block;margin:0;border:0;padding:0}input:not([type=checkbox]):not([type=radio]),select,textarea{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:6px;padding:9px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-primary,#b9c2cc);border-radius:6px;color:inherit;background:var(--color-background-secondary,#f6f8fa);font:inherit}fieldset label{display:inline-block;margin:8px 12px 0 0}.wide{grid-column:1/-1}button{padding:11px 16px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;color:#fff;background:#1559ad;border:0;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}#status{padding:10px 12px;background:var(--color-background-secondary,#f1f4f8);border-radius:6px}#receipt{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:12px}small{display:block;margin-top:6px;color:var(--color-text-secondary,#536277)}@media(max-width:480px){form{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><main><h1>Connection diagnostic</h1><p>Send seven synthetic values through the host bridge. A passing receipt confirms the exact API exchange. Client observation is recorded separately.</p><p id="status" data-state="waiting" role="status" aria-live="polite">Waiting for the host and initial result.</p>
<form><label>Text<input id="text" value="café ✓ &quot;quoted&quot;" maxlength="15"><small>Keep the fixture or clear it to test empty text.</small></label><label>Amount<input id="amount" type="number" value="0" min="0" max="0" step="1"></label><label>Accepted<input id="accepted" type="checkbox"></label><label>Choice<select id="choice"><option value="beta">beta</option></select></label><fieldset><legend>Rating</legend><label><input type="radio" id="rating" name="rating" value="hot" checked>hot</label></fieldset><label>Enabled<input id="enabled" type="checkbox"></label><label class="wide">Notes<textarea id="notes" rows="2">first
